This repository contains the TEAM VROCK website for https://www.vrock.ch.

The site uses `team-vrock/jekyll-theme-vrock@7de6bef52ccd14d21bd8aeced12e379875d4092f` during the refresh work. GitHub project cards are pinned in `_config.yml` and can be enriched into `_data/github_projects.yml` during the GitHub Actions build.
